  "name": "Fire Attunement",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Fire_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You channel flames through your body, rendering you immune to fire damage and burning those who harm you.</p><p>Until the start of your next turn, you are immune to <strong>Damage</strong> from intense heat and flames, both magical and mundane.</p><p>Additionally, any creature that <strong>Damages</strong> you with a <strong>Melee</strong> attack suffers <strong>2 Damage</strong> as heat from your body burns them in retaliation.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 rounds</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you can increase the <strong>Damage</strong> dealt to creatures that strike you in melee by <strong>+1 per additional</strong> success.</p>",
